[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **the shape and value class of the arguments**, plus **which entry point** is
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m used. Both are read off the source and the compiled code, not guessed.
